{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1391501-fan-made-sourcebooks","id":1391501,"title":"fan made sourcebooks","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-05-25T09:59:53-07:00","id":1391501,"title":"fan made sourcebooks","content":"I sadly did not get into exalted and the white wolf fandoms before the switch to onyx path. as such, I have only scraps of what was made fore. tantalizing teases of cool things. I ask you, are there more fan made sourcebooks in the vien of nocternals and eternals? and if so, can you direct me to where I can get my hands on a pdf copy? <br /> <br /> I already have nocternals and eternals, so yeah. and sorry to any mods I might get angry with this thread. my posting privilages only came a few days ago.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26173-evtrax","name":"evtrax","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-26T21:27:13-07:00","id":1391857,"title":"","content":"Long ago, a good 12 years plus a guy in the Exalted Compendium Redux wrote a supplement for the Long Second Age.<br /> <br /> Imagine creation much like the modern age technology (no internet though) where theme Wyld Hunt is more like Men in Black.<br /> <br /> Great write-up, piles of custom gunklaive (yes gun and a sword) charms, driving charms, the whole bit.<br /> <br /> WW offered to buy it from him and turn it into a 1e supplement.<br /> <br /> He said no, that it should remain free and open to all.<br /> <br /> Principled, I guess. Long term? Stupid and proud.<br /> <br /> Now it's gone and few fans if any remember it.<br /> <br /> I tried digging for it 5years ago and came up with nothing. Most of the fans from that period are gone and replaced by new ones with no recollection of such a thing.<br /> <br /> Another tidbit: The first Exalted compendium forum held so much custom content in it. Charms, artifacts, nations and so much more. Vibrant discussion (with a healthy dose of early 2000s &quot;fuck you and die&quot; toxicity thrown in too.) The owner (Yoshi, I believe) let the site lapse and let it all be destroyed, why I couldn't tell you. The founder of the Exalted compendium Redux offered to pay Yoshi for it, who said no.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2783,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2783-tytalus","user":"Tytalus","date":". 05-27-2020, 10:59 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2783-tytalus","name":"Tytalus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2783_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"491"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-27T01:47:25-07:00","id":1391884,"title":"","content":"ok then. that's not very useful to me. good story though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26173-evtrax","name":"evtrax","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-27T07:54:57-07:00","id":1391934,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>evtrax</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exa